  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1\t\tA1A\tThe development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - 2\tB5\tThe proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - 3\tB4\tNo development shall take place until samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details.",
    "Condition : 4 - 4\tC5\tNotwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development Order) 1995 (or any order revoking or re-enacting that order) no enlargement of the premises or any additional structures/buildings within the curtilage of the site shall be carried out.",
    "Condition : 5 - 5\tC8\tNotwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995 (or any order revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification), no windows/dormer windows [other than those expressly authorised by this permission] shall be constructed.",
    "Condition : 6 - 6\tNON-STD\tBefore development commences details of the vehicle crossovers and sightlines at the point of access to the public highway shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and the development shall be carried out in accordance with the details",
    "Condition : 7 - 7\tNON-STD\tBefore development commences details shall be submitted to the Council for approval in writing showing proposed landscaping along the front boundary of the site including replacement trees for those removed to form the vehicle crossovers.",
    "Condition : 8 - 8\tNON-STD\tNo development shall take place until details of a Sustainable Drainage Scheme, including measures for the harvesting of rainwater, the minimisation of water run-off from the site, aiming for greenfield levels, and the conservation and reuse as appropriate of other water supplies in the building have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  These details shall be carried out as approved.",
    "Condition : 9 - 9\tNON-STD\tNo development shall take place until details have be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority for a scheme of acoustic insulation and any associated ventilation to ensure the maximum noise level to be permitted within dwellings with windows shut and any other necessary means of ventilation provided shall not exceed the \"good\" limits contained in BS8233:1999. These being LAeq,16hour = 30 dB in living rooms, and a night(07:00 - 23:00) LAeq,8hour = 30 dB and LAFmax = 45 dB in bedrooms, and a night LAeq,1hour = 45 dB in Kitchens, Bathrooms and Utility Rooms \".  The details shall be carried out as approved.",
    "Condition : 10 - 10\tNON-STD\tAll boilers installed must be low NOx boilers, conforming to at least NOX class 3 or better.",
    "Condition : 11 - 11\tNON-STD\tThe demolition hereby permitted shall not be commenced before a contract for the redevelopment of the site has been made, on which work is to commence within 3 months, or such longer period that may have been agreed by the Local Planning Authority in writing. ."
  ],
